  "id": "self-analysis",
  "term": "self-analysis",
  "definition": "In this historical source, self-analysis means an unhealthy turning of attention inward in which a person becomes overly occupied with interpreting their own feelings and experiences. It is described as linked with morbid self-consciousness, especially when someone wrongly takes outside remarks or actions as being about them.",
